&lt;p style="margin-left: 96px; line-height: 16px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;Grainger Global Holdings, Inc. (非上場）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 84px; line-height: 16px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
